  lessonId: 02_ohms_law
  title: Ohm's Law
  goal: Understand voltage, current, and resistance.
  steps:
  - title: Voltage
    instruction: Voltage is a potential difference between two points.
    hint: This is an authored educational example. Compare it to verified measurements
      in your current level.
    requiredVerifiedActionId: 
