  - title: Current
    instruction: Current is the rate of electric charge flow. Under Ohmic conditions,
      I = V/R.
    hint: This is an authored educational example. Compare it to verified measurements
      in your current level.
    requiredVerifiedActionId: 
    advanceWhenVerified: 0
    annotations: []
    schematic:
