        position: {x: 0.33333334, y: 0.56}
        label: Voltage
        color: {r: 0.3, g: 0.88, b: 1, a: 1}
      - id: 02_ohms_law_symbol_1
        kind: 1
        position: {x: 0.6666667, y: 0.56}
        label: Resistance
        color: {r: 0.3, g: 0.88, b: 1, a: 1}
      wires: []
  - title: Resistance
    instruction: A larger fixed resistance reduces current at the same voltage in
      a simple resistive model. This is an estimate, not a measurement of your current
      level.
    hint: This is an authored educational example. Compare it to verified measurements
